<title>MAURITIUS: Mauritius rupee weakens against dollar.</title>
<headline>Mauritius rupee weakens against dollar.</headline>
<dateline>PORT LOUIS 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Mauritian rupee weakened against dollar but strengthened slightly against the pound sterling, reflecting international market trends, foreign exchange dealers said on Monday.</p>
<p>The rupee was fixed at a mean commercial rate of 21.7105 to the dollar from 21.6055 on Friday and at 35.424 to the pound from 35.4435 on Friday. Dealers said there was a shortage of hard currencies.</p>
<p>--Clifford Vellien ++230 211-9555</p>
